# Wide bracket pair extraction source in standard Brainfuck
# Input consists of five byte bracket records and final marker
# Output pair kind followed by opening and closing positions
# Each position is an unsigned 24 bit little endian integer
# Final bytes are zero marker and status code
# Stack frames occupy five cells at addresses 32 through 1306
# Cell 27 is the zero sentinel for walking backward
# Each stack frame has active flag and four raw metadata bytes
# Status one means bad record or unbalanced brackets
# Status three means nesting exceeds 255 levels
# This stage is not yet an Android branch relocation emitter
>[-]+
# Initialize record processing
[<,>>>>>>>[-]<<<[-]>[-]<<<<<[->>>>+>+<<<<<]>>>>>[-<<<<<+>>>>>]>[-]+<<[[-]>>[-]<<]>>[[-]<<<<<[-]>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>,<<<<<<<<<<<<<[-]>[-]>>>>>>>>>>>>[-<<<<<<<<<<<<<+>+>>>>>>>>>>>>]<<<<<<<<<<<<[->>>>>>>>>>>>+<<<<<<<<<<<<]<[[-]<<[-]>>>[-]>>>>>>>>>>>>[-<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<+>>>+>>>>>>>>>>>>]<<<<<<<<<<<<[->>>>>>>>>>>>+<<<<<<<<<<<<]<]>>]<<[-]>[-]<<<<[->>>+>+<<<<]>>>>[-<<<<+>>>>]>[-]+<<[[-]>>[-]<<][-]>[-]>[-<<+>+>]<[->+<]<<[-]+>[[-]<[-]>]<[[-]>[-]>[-]<<<<<[->>>>+>+<<<<<]>>>>>[-<<<<<+>>>>>]<-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<[-]+>[[-]<[-]>]<[[-]>>>>[-]+<<<[-]>[-]>>>>>>>>[-<<<<<<<<<+>+>>>>>>>>]<<<<<<<<[->>>>>>>>+<<<<<<<<]<+<[-]+>[[-]<[-]>]<[[-]<[-]+++>]>[-]>[-]<<<[->>+>+<<<]>>>[-<<<+>>>]>[-]+<<[[-]>>[-]<<]>>[[-]>>>>>>>+>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>[>>>>>]+>,>,>,>,<<<<<<<<<[<<<<<]>>>>><<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<]<<<]>[-]>[-]<<<<<[->>>>+>+<<<<<]>>>>>[-<<<<<+>>>>>]<---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<[-]+>[[-]<[-]>]<[[-]>>>>[-]+<<<[-]>[-]>>>>>>>>[-<<<<<<<<<+>+>>>>>>>>]<<<<<<<<[->>>>>>>>+<<<<<<<<]>[-]+<<[[-]>>[-]<<]>>[[-]<<<<[-]+>>>>]<<[-]>[-]<<<[->>+>+<<<]>>>[-<<<+>>>]>[-]+<<[[-]>>[-]<<]>>[[-]>>>>,>,>,>>,>>[-]+++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++.>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>[>>>>>]<<<<<[-]>.>.>.<<<<<<<<[<<<<<]>>>>><<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<.>.>.>-<<<<<<<]<<<]>[-]>[-]>>[-<<<+>+>>]<<[->>+<<]>[-]+<<[[-]>>[-]<<]>>[[-]<<<<[-]+>>>>]<<[-]>[-]<<<[->>+>+<<<]>>>[-<<<+>>>]<[[-]<<<[-]>>>]<]<<]
# Consume and pair incoming wide bracket metadata
>>>[-]>[-]<<<[->>+>+<<<]>>>[-<<<+>>>]>[-]+<<[[-]>>[-]<<]>>[[-]<<[-]>[-]>>>>>>>>[-<<<<<<<<<+>+>>>>>>>>]<<<<<<<<[->>>>>>>>+<<<<<<<<]<[[-]<<[-]+>>]>>]>>>>>>>>>>[-].<<<<<<<<<<<<<<.
